  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">現實中的樹木是<strong>圓柱形</strong>的 &ndash; 為什麼在 Minecraft 中不是呢？好吧，我製作了一個旨在解決這個問題的資源包！</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">現在你可以安心了，知道你的樹木終於恢復了它們應有的圓潤形狀。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">與其他資源包完全相容，只需確保將「Round Trees」放在載入順序的最頂端即可！</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1325/116/2025-09-15_11-54-11-webp.webp\" alt=\"一棵巨大的圓形橡木俯瞰著充滿其他圓形樹木的森林\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/296616/description_dd79c2f8-007f-491a-98b2-ced3f8c5b4bf.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"739\" height=\"135\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">想要茂密葉片嗎？請查看配套資源包，<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/motschens-better-leaves\" rel=\"nofollow\">Motschen's Better Leaves。</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/motschens-better-leaves\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/296616/description_9d06bbdd-8ddf-4736-9d77-6167f48dac56.webp\" alt=\"Better Leaves 標誌\" width=\"496\" height=\"79\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">明確支援的模組 (v8.0)：</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fad-astra\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ad Astra</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252farchitects-palette\" rel=\"nofollow\">Architect's Palette</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\">Atmospheric</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252faurorasdecorations\" rel=\"nofollow\">Aurora's Decorations</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\">Autumnity</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbetterend\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better End</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbetternether\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Nether</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbewitchment\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bewitchment</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbiome-makeover\" rel=\"nofollow\">Biome Makeover</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbiomes-o-plenty\" rel=\"nofollow\">Biomes O' Plenty</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\">Blockus</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fblossom\" rel=\"nofollow\">Blossom</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\">Botania</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\">Chipped</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\">Cluttered</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcobblemon\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cobblemon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/mod/croptopia\" rel=\"nofollow\">Croptopia</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\">Cultural Delights</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fdeeperdarker\" rel=\"nofollow\">Deeper and Darker</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fecologics\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ecologics</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fends-phantasm\" rel=\"nofollow\">End's Phantasm</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fenvironmental\" rel=\"nofollow\">Environmental</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\">Fortuituous Feasts</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\">Hellion's Sniffer+</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\">Hibernal Herbs</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252flets-do-beachparty\" rel=\"nofollow\">[Let's Do] Beachparty</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252flets-do-blooming-nature\" rel=\"nofollow\">[Let's Do] Blooming Nature</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252flets-do-meadow\" rel=\"nofollow\">[Let's Do] Meadow</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252flets-do-vinery\" rel=\"nofollow\">[Let's Do] Vinery</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fnatures-spirit\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nature's Spirit</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fnethers-exoticism\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nether's Exoticism</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmariposa\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mariposa</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252foh-the-biomes-weve-gone\" rel=\"nofollow\">Oh The Biomes We've Gone</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fparadise-lost\" rel=\"nofollow\">Paradise Lost</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\">Promenade</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fquark\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quark</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fregions-unexplored\" rel=\"nofollow\">Regions Unexplored</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ftech-reborn\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tech Reborn</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fterrestria\" rel=\"nofollow\">Terrestria</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\">Terraqueous</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fthe-undergarden\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Undergarden</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ftraverse\" rel=\"nofollow\">Traverse</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fthe-aether\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Aether</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fwilder-wild\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wilder Wild</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>",
